P06 kit's folders and naming (p06_import_core.py:63-66 / :252-258) [prec, ran].

Tiers per claim: [decl] read in source/header/config (cited), [prec] an in-repo tool made the same call and it RAN
(cited with its record), [meas] measured offline here (file hash / JSON read), [inf] inferred (why).

WHAT IS NEW vs the P06 kit (everything else is the P06 kit's code path, unchanged):
  * Manifests are ARGS (any passage, several at once); entries are keyed by OWNER (the v1 manifest has no pick_n
    [meas IMPORT_MANIFEST.json]).  Owners must start with "<intended_passage>_" (P06_real_.., P02_real_.., VAL_real_..
