  * HEIGHT FROM THE MANIFEST, never hard-coded: wings z = bottom_z_cm .. height_cm + top_above_panel_cm (P06 1000 ->
    -100..1020 [meas]; P02's 12 m -> -100..1220 [inf until P02 v2 builds exist: same builder, socket_contract.py:97-103
    [decl]]); pivot socket at height_cm/2 (socket_contract.py:69-75 [decl]).
  * TOP-BORDER mount (valances): rz_build_one.py:14-16,158-167 drops --bake-poles and validates with --kind wave
